Remove the version-less duplicate declaration of org.yaml:snakeyaml.

Maven >= 3.10 rejects duplicate dependencies in a POM as a model
validation error. The versioned declaration earlier in the file is kept
so the version still comes from the snakeyaml.version property.
--- a/pom.xml
+++ b/pom.xml
@@ -332,10 +332,6 @@
             <artifactId>javers-core</artifactId>
         </dependency>
 
-        <dependency>
-            <groupId>org.yaml</groupId>
-            <artifactId>snakeyaml</artifactId>
-        </dependency>
 
         <dependency>
             <groupId>org.graalvm.polyglot</groupId>
